$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2stkup3  LOC_AFTER=?

* Three updates of a stack assignment at two distinct indices: the second update at ` K ` overrides the first.  One machine step that pops ` K ` and pushes on ` J ` produces exactly this term; ~ tm2stkupc and ~ tm2stkup2 collapse it.

